<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<h1 class="h3 mb-3">About</h1>
<p>
    The <strong>TcxTool</strong> application was developed by <strong>Chris Joakim</strong> as an
    experiment of using the <strong>Software Factory</strong> approach to develop software
    in an entirely hands-off manner using <strong>Claude Code</strong> and <strong>Spec-Kit</strong>.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Spec-Kit Process</h2>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Spec-Kit Project Startup</h2>
<ul>
    <li>/speckit-constitution - Establish project principles</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Spec-Kit Feature/Spec Development Loop</h2>
<ul>
    <li>/speckit-specify - Create baseline specification</li>
    <li>/speckit-plan - Create implementation plan</li>
    <li>/speckit-tasks - Generate actionable tasks</li>
    <li>/speckit-implement - Execute implementation</li>
    <li>/speckit-converge - Assess the codebase and append remaining work as tasks</li>
</ul>

